<title>USA: Seward Cty, USD 483, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Seward Cty, USD 483, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $6.155 million of Seward Cty USD 483, Kan., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.01 percent.</p>
</text>
